(text "FLUX INTERFACE\nOutputs: SN74LS07 open-collector, 40 mA sink (drives 150R terminators), 1k pull-ups to +5V.\n  MCU low = bus line asserted (active low), MCU high/reset = released.\nInputs: 1k pull-ups to +5V, 74LVC14A Schmitt inverter at 3V3 (5V-tolerant inputs).\n  MCU sees INVERTED level: high = drive asserts line. RDATA/INDEX capture on rising edge." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e69a4701-99fe-5f04-947d-a73177992549"))
